# IDEA HUNTER — Opportunity Intelligence Engine Roadmap

> Upgrading from a **7/10 complaint mining system** to a **9/10 Opportunity Intelligence Engine**

---

## The Philosophy Shift

**Current (7/10):**
> "Find complaints → score complaints."

**Target (9/10):**
> "Find signals → discover problems → validate problems → investigate markets → identify gaps → construct opportunities → attack them → score them based on evidence → recommend what should be validated in the real world."

The pipeline stays. The philosophy changes.

