## Phase 5 — Make it Autonomous

```
Nightly Cron
      ↓
Collect (all sources)
      ↓
Process (embed → cluster → extract)
      ↓
Research (all agents)
      ↓
Score (evidence-backed)
      ↓
Rank (delta from last run)
      ↓
Notify (new opportunities, rising signals, falling confidence)
```

Add a `--since` flag to all collectors so nightly runs only pull new data, not re-pull everything.

