## What to NOT Build Next

| Temptation | Verdict | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| More dashboard polish | ❌ Skip for now | Dashboard is sufficient. Scores aren't trustworthy yet. |
| More LLM agents without fixing scoring | ❌ Skip | More agents on bad inputs = more confident wrong answers |
| Adding 15 autonomous agents at once | ❌ Skip | Over-agentization. Keep deterministic where possible. |
| Replacing architecture entirely | ❌ Skip | Foundation is solid. Don't restart. |

---

## Engineering Principle: Deterministic First, Agentic Where It Matters

```
DETERMINISTIC (keep as code logic)
───────────────────────────────────
Collection
Filtering
Deduplication
Embedding
Clustering
Cost logging
Basic validation rules

AGENTIC (use LLM where reasoning is actually required)
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Problem interpretation
Market research
Competitor research
Customer analysis
Solution generation
Technical feasibility
Devil's Advocate
Final synthesis
```

